title: "Coexisting with Whales"
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ermilov"
    given-names: "Almaz"
    orcid: ""
abstract: >-
  Interactive map of cetacean observations and vessel strike risk in Norwegian
  and surrounding waters. Builds a transparent screening score per port and per
  sea region by combining GBIF cetacean records, EMODnet vessel density and the
  Vanderlaan and Taggart 2007 logistic curve for vessel-strike lethality.
keywords:
  - cetaceans
  - whales
  - Norway
  - vessel strike
  - ship strike
  - GBIF
  - EMODnet
  - conservation
  - data visualization
